<includeonly><div class="card-photo" style="width:{{{width|280}}}px;max-width:100%;"><div class="card-photo-viewport" style="position:relative;width:{{{width|280}}}px;height:{{#switch:{{{rotation|}}}|left|right={{#expr:({{{crop_width}}})*{{{width|280}}}/({{#switch:{{{rotation|}}}|left|right={{{crop_height}}}|#default={{{crop_width}}}}})}}|#default={{#expr:({{{crop_height}}})*{{{width|280}}}/({{#switch:{{{rotation|}}}|left|right={{{crop_height}}}|#default={{{crop_width}}}}})}}}}px;overflow:hidden;"><div class="card-photo-crop" style="position:absolute;overflow:hidden;width:{{#expr:({{{crop_width}}})*{{{width|280}}}/({{#switch:{{{rotation|}}}|left|right={{{crop_height}}}|#default={{{crop_width}}}}})}}px;height:{{#expr:({{{crop_height}}})*{{{width|280}}}/({{#switch:{{{rotation|}}}|left|right={{{crop_height}}}|#default={{{crop_width}}}}})}}px;left:{{#switch:{{{rotation|}}}|right={{#expr:({{{crop_height}}})*{{{width|280}}}/({{#switch:{{{rotation|}}}|left|right={{{crop_height}}}|#default={{{crop_width}}}}})}}|180={{#expr:({{{crop_width}}})*{{{width|280}}}/({{#switch:{{{rotation|}}}|left|right={{{crop_height}}}|#default={{{crop_width}}}}})}}|#default=0}}px;top:{{#switch:{{{rotation|}}}|left={{#expr:({{{crop_width}}})*{{{width|280}}}/({{#switch:{{{rotation|}}}|left|right={{{crop_height}}}|#default={{{crop_width}}}}})}}|180={{#expr:({{{crop_height}}})*{{{width|280}}}/({{#switch:{{{rotation|}}}|left|right={{{crop_height}}}|#default={{{crop_width}}}}})}}|#default=0}}px;transform:rotate({{#switch:{{{rotation|}}}|left=-90|right=90|180=180|#default=0}}deg);transform-origin:0 0;{{#if:{{{polygon|}}}|clip-path:polygon({{{polygon}}});}}"><div class="card-photo-source" style="position:absolute;width:{{#expr:({{{source_width}}})*{{{width|280}}}/({{#switch:{{{rotation|}}}|left|right={{{crop_height}}}|#default={{{crop_width}}}}})}}px;left:{{#expr:(-{{{crop_x|0}}})*{{{width|280}}}/({{#switch:{{{rotation|}}}|left|right={{{crop_height}}}|#default={{{crop_width}}}}})}}px;top:{{#expr:(-{{{crop_y|0}}})*{{{width|280}}}/({{#switch:{{{rotation|}}}|left|right={{{crop_height}}}|#default={{{crop_width}}}}})}}px;line-height:0;">[[File:{{{file}}}|{{#expr:ceil({{#expr:({{{source_width}}})*{{{width|280}}}/({{#switch:{{{rotation|}}}|left|right={{{crop_height}}}|#default={{{crop_width}}}}})}})}}px|link={{{link|File:{{{file}}}}}}|alt={{{alt|Card photograph}}}]]</div></div></div><small>[[:File:{{{file}}}|Original photograph]]</small></div></includeonly><noinclude>Display-only framing of an unchanged source photograph. Parameters: file, source_width, crop_x, crop_y, crop_width, crop_height (original pixel coordinates), rotation (left, right, 180 or empty), width (default 280), link, alt, polygon (optional conservative CSS outline). The complete original remains linked. Do not use the frame to hide card borders, text or symbols. [[Category:Templates]]</noinclude>